# L §8.4: "a step or a count that isn't positive" is refused; a stepped range's step known only at the key: RUN-DOMAIN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input st: money PLN
input cap: money PLN
def c: money PLN = min(g for g in 0 PLN .. cap step st) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  st = 0.00
  cap = 10.00

ask q: c law 2026-06-30
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-DOMAIN ...
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
